OL,3,GNEWSA'Hardest childhood' town needs
OL,4,A'support' not title
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of the town ranked the
OL,7,Fhardest place to grow up in England
OL,8,Fsaid he would be lodging a formal
OL,9,Fcomplaint and the area needed "support"
OL,10,Fnot labels.
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough topped the Childhood
OL,13,FLottery report, published by the
OL,14,FChildren's Commissioner on Monday,
OL,15,Fwhich analysed metrics such as
OL,16,Feducation, health and children's views
OL,17,Fon their area.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1793004954
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Hardest childhood' town needs
OL,4,A'support' not title
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Labour mayor Chris Cooke said the
OL,7,Fcommissioner, Dame Rachel de Souza, did
OL,8,Fnot engage with him during her visit
OL,9,Fand said the different bodies needed to
OL,10,Fwork together.
OL,12,FDame Rachel said she agreed with
OL,13,FCooke's call for "a coming together of
OL,14,Fminds to address the challenges" and
OL,15,Fthe team reached out to all local
OL,16,Fauthorities in the report.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
